              </name>
            </person-group>
            <article-title>The etymology of microbial nomenclature and the diseases these cause in a historical perspective.</article-title>
            <source>Saudi J Biol Sci</source>
            <year>2022</year>
            <month>Nov</month>
            <volume>29</volume>
